[{"id":3226052835,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7ASajj","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?u=68d23e7ee9cdf810da125e8510b72f845b9dccc8&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Tested locally, it works as expected (including undo/redo).\r\n\r\n**Testing project:** [test_pr_110493.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/22350438/test_pr_110493.zip)\r\n\r\nHowever, there are certain situations where clicking a render vertex won't select all physics vertices. This occurs more often at higher subdivision levels in a BoxMesh, especially when asymmetric subdivision (e.g. 5 on width/depth, 1 on height).\r\n\r\nHere, I couldn't get it to happen once:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/bdb335ee-4f50-4ed3-8999-17e6c31c1bcc\r\n\r\nBut as soon as I added more subdivision levels, it started happening more often on edges/corners:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f6f9cb41-426d-44e3-b28b-780dfe580d9b\r\n\r\nThe issue will depend on camera angle in the editor. Notice that duplicated points are drawn several times (you can see their color *slightly* changing when one of them is pinned, as each point gizmo is translucent).\r\n","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110493#pullrequestreview-3226052835","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/110493","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110493#pullrequestreview-3226052835"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/110493"}},"submitted_at":"2025-09-15T19:51:27Z","commit_id":null},{"id":3281913003,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7DngSr","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?u=68d23e7ee9cdf810da125e8510b72f845b9dccc8&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"I've tested the PR again on the MRP I linked in my first review. It *mostly* seems to work great now, but I encountered a scenario where I was able to visually unpin all points, yet one point actually remained pinned:\n\n<img width=\"576\" height=\"539\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ef02d338-f2d8-47b5-8abb-df3f9cf24f84\" />\n\n<img width=\"300\" height=\"301\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/dbff2063-3862-4d48-8f8e-aac